    "karo": "Mature slate crow with long angular sideways beak, tiny half-lidded skeptical eyes, rough teal crest and narrow crooked stance. Hatless red-brown mail jacket, ochre vest, cream collar, satchel strap/buckle. Tugging strap and short feather-wing route gesture; no human hand or thumb.",
